===Etymology===
Origin {{unk|en|title=unknown}}. Perhaps of {{der|en|gmq}} origin (compare {{der|en|non|skutill|t=bolt, harpoon}}, {{cog|da|skyttel|t=shuttle, child's toy}}). Compare also {{cog|ang|sċytel|t=a dart, bolt}}. More at {{m|en|shuttle}}.

